            {
              "id": "c2",
              "name": "operational_rules",
              "value": "Critical commercial/cooling incidents affecting business-critical spaces should be prioritized. Prefer qualified technicians with compatible skills, earlier availability, shorter travel distance, and required truck parts. If no technician safely satisfies the constraints, escalate to a manager. Do not invent availability or inventory.",
